# {{ project_name }} — delivery hub

Central, versioned home for **{{ project_name }}** ({{ client }}): project context, knowledge base,
PRD and backlog, links to the product repositories, and generated delivery material.

Generated from the [agentic-delivery](https://github.com/danielmschaves/agentic-delivery) template.

## Quick start

```bash
uv sync                       # install tooling
uv run pre-commit install --install-hooks -t pre-commit -t commit-msg
cp .env.example .env          # fill in credentials for enabled adapters
uv run ad doctor              # verify config, adapters and credentials
claude                        # work with the agent (see CLAUDE.md)
```

Pull template improvements: `uvx copier update`.
